oth setting defaults, or conditional defaults for both fields and for form control HTML attributes. A notable extension, included here, is displaying different label and help text for address form fields to adjust between assuming a local country postal format vs. a more international format while adding a country field (but only when needed). ","topics":[],"score":260168,"global_rank":51345},{"name":"richford/personal-website-source","owner":"richford","html_url":"https://github.com/richford/personal-website-source","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Source code for my personal website. Built with Pelican.","topics":[],"score":260164,"global_rank":51347},{"name":"VladAndral/UWB_Capstone_PACCAR_HASI_Tester","owner":"VladAndral","html_url":"https://github.com/VladAndral/UWB_Capstone_PACCAR_HASI_Tester","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":4,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":260164,"global_rank":51349},{"name":"masonzorer/Unstoppable-Alarm","owner":"masonzorer","html_url":"https://github.com/masonzorer/Unstoppable-Alarm","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Loud, terrible music and a shutoff criteria; this alarm is guaranteed to wake you up. Trained an audio classification model to identify the sound of running water.","topics":[],"score":260163,"global_rank":51350},{"name":"DariaSidorko/AI_Sales_Prototype","owner":"DariaSidorko","html_url":"https://github.com/DariaSidorko/AI_Sales_Prototype","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":260157,"global_rank":51357},{"name":"F5Networks/f5-openstack-test","owner":"F5Networks","html_url":"https://github.com/F5Networks/f5-openstack-test","stars":2,"forks":5,"watchers":6,"issues":13,"language":"Python","description":"F5 Networks\u00ae  common python modules for OpenStack tests","topics":[],"score":260155,"global_rank":51360},{"name":"AllenInstitute/ophy